# Task Completion Notifier

After the requested task has been verified and before the completed final
response, run exactly one manual attempt:

```sh
python3 __NOTIFIER_PY_SH__ \
  --message "<concise, non-sensitive completed-task summary>"
```

If the command fails, state that the OS notification was not delivered while
still returning the task result. Do not call platform notification commands
directly; the bundled notifier selects and checks the platform.
